WEBVTT

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:35.190
I CAN'T HEAR
THE FIREWORKS, PART 2

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:36.200
<i>Tonight...</i>

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:40.200
<i>Tonight I'm going to a fireworks display!</i>

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:46.710
<i>Even if Miss Fujiwara is a major pain,
for this one night, I'll let it go.</i>

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:50.840
<i>Because she went as far as canceling
a trip so she could go with me.</i>

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:54.630
<i>It really has been
a boring summer vacation.</i>

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:57.680
<i>For the first time, I'll go out with friends.</i>

00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:59.640
There's no difference.

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:02.600
<i>My first time
going out with the president.</i>

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:05.270
<i>I won't watch from the window</i>

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:09.190
<i>because I finally get to go see
the huge fireworks up close!</i>

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:16.530
<i>I think that alone is enough for me</i>

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:21.280
<i>to enjoy this whole summer vacation.</i>

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:26.910
See you later.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:34.590
<i>It really has been
a boring summer vacation.</i>

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:36.340
I'm afraid not.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:40.090
Lately, your behavior
has been unacceptable, milady.

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:44.640
And with a large crowd,
it would be easy to lose sight of you.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:47.060
If something happened to you
during that time,

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.730
what would I say to your father?

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:55.020
<i>I'm sure he wouldn't care.</i>

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:59.860
I'M SORRY.
I WON'T BE ABLE TO GO TODAY.
I'M REALLY SORRY.

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:59.860
FROM: KAGUYA
SUBJECT: I'M SORRY

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:59.150
"I'm really sorry."

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:01.860
Miss Kaguya.

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.960
<i>I want to see everyone.</i>

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.670
<i>I wish I'd never known about it.</i>

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:19.970
<i>If I hadn't known,</i>

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:22.470
<i>it would've been a normal summer,</i>

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:25.720
<i>and I wouldn't have suffered like this.</i>

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.940
<i>But... But it's okay.</i>

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.400
<i>Summer will be over soon.</i>

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:35.650
<i>It's okay.</i>

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:38.150
<i>It's okay.</i>

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:40.320
<i>It's okay.</i>

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.040
It's okay.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:54.670
KAGUYA
I'M A SECOND-YEAR HIGH SCHOOL STUDENT
AT SHUCHIIN ACADEMY.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:54.670
THANK YOU FOR CHECKING OUT MY PAGE.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:57.670
KAGUYA / 5 DAYS AGO
THIS IS MY FIRST TWEET.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.680
KAGUYA / RIGHT NOW
I WANT TO SEE THE FIREWORKS WITH EVERYONE.

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:13.350
Roger.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:17.440
KAGUYA / RIGHT NOW
I WANT TO SEE THE FIREWORKS WITH EVERYONE.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:17.440
KAGUYA / 5 DAYS AGO
THIS IS MY FIRST TWEET.

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:26.490
Lady Kaguya, how long
do you intend to lie there like that?

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:28.120
This isn't like you.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:33.460
Normally, by this point, you'd be sneaking
out of the house by hook or by crook.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:36.960
No matter what I do, it won't work out.

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:39.750
I couldn't go shopping with everyone,

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:43.720
and my father has no interest
in me whatsoever.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:49.470
The president didn't even send me
a single text this past month.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:52.350
Nothing at all has worked out for me!

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:55.270
Even if I left the house right now,
it would be meaningless!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.810
I'll never be able to see them again!

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:01.860
No, you'll see them once school starts
whether you like it or not.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.070
Misfortunes never come singly.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:08.160
When you're dejected,
you really go all out.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:13.870
Certainly, you've been
through a rough summer.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:19.040
But maybe not seeing President Shirogane
once over vacation was the best choice

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.340
if you think about it
from a long-term perspective.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.380
Time without seeing someone
makes the heart fonder.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:30.800
I'm sure the president feels
the same way you do right now.

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.140
He wants to see you so badly every day.

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.400
He counts on his fingers

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.980
how many days are left
of summer vacation.

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:46.070
Meanwhile,

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:49.700
if he could somehow meet you
in a date with destiny,

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:53.040
his accumulated desire...

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:58.000
...would be set free all at once?

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:00.210
That's right. There you go.

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:02.550
Now you look like the Lady Kaguya I know.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:06.380
But two of this house's butlers
are here right now.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:10.970
There's no way I can escape from here
without any preparation.

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:12.390
Preparation, you say?

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.150
WIRELESS

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:26.150
J. SUZUKI OF KOENJI
ONE OF THE METRO AREA'S
BIG FOUR RAMEN KINGS

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:33.740
Take me to Hamamatsucho!

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:35.080
Please!

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:38.460
Lady Kaguya,

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:40.580
dinner is ready.

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:43.290
I'm not hungry.

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:44.590
I'm going to bed.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:46.800
I'm watching the fireworks.

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:49.220
You don't have a problem
with that, do you?

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.220
Very well.

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:00.100
Gotcha.

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:05.860
I get the picture.

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:16.870
Miss Kaguya!

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:19.040
She may be around there.

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:22.040
Please stay here, Fujiwara!

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:25.500
<i>The phone number you have called</i>

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:30.510
<i>is turned off or out of our service area.</i>

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.720
It's not going through.

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.390
Is it because of the crowd?

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:37.520
Or because my phone is old?

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:38.930
Why?

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:41.520
Young lady, you want to go
see the fireworks, right?

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:45.110
There's a lot of traffic tonight
with all the cars out.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:48.150
I think you might not make it in time.

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:50.990
<i>I won't make it in time?</i>

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:53.570
<i>After what Hayasaka did for me?</i>

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.120
<i>It can't be!</i>

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:58.660
<i>Why won't anything work out for me?</i>

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:02.790
Excuse me.

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:03.870
Yes?

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.630
I'll go the rest of the way on foot.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:14.340
Be careful, young lady.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:15.930
I will!

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:30.780
<i>We're supposed to meet up
at Takeshiba Wharf.</i>

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:32.360
<i>The main streets are really crowded.</i>

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:35.820
<i>If I run down a backstreet,
I should be able to just make it!</i>

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:42.540
<i>I'm sure I'll meet up with them!</i>

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.920
<i>The first younger student I've helped...</i>

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:49.670
<i>The person who became my first friend...</i>

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:55.180
<i>The first person I like...</i>

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:59.180
<i>I'm in that circle of people!</i>

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:03.060
SHOPPING
FIREWORKS FESTIVAL

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:03.060
<i>All summer,</i>

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:08.060
<i>the only thing I've been thinking about
is how happy I would be</i>

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:11.150
<i>if I got to gaze
at those beautiful fireworks</i>

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:13.650
<i>together with my favorite people,</i>

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:17.070
<i>and how wonderful it would be.</i>

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:18.570
<i>God...</i>

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:20.580
<i>this summer,</i>

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:24.710
<i>I don't need love or romance!</i>

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:27.580
<i>So...</i>

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:33.380
<i>So, at least let me be
together with them!</i>

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:38.180
<i>...has concluded.</i>

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.930
<i>When you leave,</i>

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:43.220
<i>please pick up your trash,</i>

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:46.060
<i>food and beverages.</i>

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:48.810
<i>Again,</i>

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:53.650
<i>this evening's fireworks display
has concluded.</i>

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:57.110
<i>When you leave,</i>

00:09:57.610 --> 00:10:01.740
<i>please pick up your trash,
food and beverages.</i>

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:04.500
<i>Oh, that's right.</i>

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:08.250
<i>There is...</i>

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:10.840
<i>no God.</i>

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:21.010
<i>I wonder if they enjoyed the fireworks.</i>

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:23.560
<i>I hope so.</i>

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:28.480
<i>I only got to see the fireworks
from between the buildings,</i>

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:30.310
<i>but they were so big.</i>

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:35.400
<i>For them, the fireworks
must have looked beautiful.</i>

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:41.530
<i>If everyone else got to enjoy them,
that's enough for me.</i>

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:53.540
I wanted to see them, too!

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:56.300
The fireworks...

00:10:58.220 --> 00:10:59.550
With everyone!

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:04.100
Then, I'll show them to you.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:07.680
President?

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:10.900
Come with me, Shinomiya!

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:14.020
If you wanna see them that badly,
I'll show them to you!

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:15.520
How...

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:18.940
How did you know I was here?

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:24.160
You mean the "Guess Shinomiya's Thoughts
and Search for Her" game?

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:28.250
Compared to the usual,
it was 100 times easier.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:36.090
Miss Kaguya!

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:39.050
President, I got us a car!

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:40.760
That young lady again!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.640
Everyone hop in!

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:51.480
There!

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:00.900
Driver,

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.400
get on the expressway,

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:04.660
and then take the Aqua-Line
towards Umihotaru!

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:09.290
There are fireworks that were postponed
until tonight because of the rain.

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:11.660
President, you mean...

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:12.960
Chiba!

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:16.170
The Kisarazu fireworks display
goes until 8:30!

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:20.380
Can we get to Chiba
in the next 20 minutes?

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:21.170
I don't know!

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:24.010
But it's worth the challenge.

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:26.680
We're gonna show Shinomiya
some fireworks!

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:32.690
I'll step on it, then.

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:34.810
This is just between you and me.

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:37.570
<i>Who is this cool driver?</i>

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:40.280
J. SUZUKI OF KOENJI
ONE OF THE METRO AREA'S
BIG FOUR RAMEN KINGS

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:46.370
God, let us be in time!

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:53.210
President! I can't see anything outside!

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:57.210
The Aqua-Line is an undersea tunnel!
Of course you can't see anything!

00:12:58.210 --> 00:12:59.920
A sign for Umihotaru service parking!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:01.380
We're surfacing!

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:04.090
Let us be in time!

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:05.840
Let us be in time!

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:14.350
Let us be in time!

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:45.260
<i>Their focus is on the fireworks.</i>

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:50.010
<i>But I'm sorry.</i>

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.680
<i>I can't take my eyes off of...</i>

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:59.020
<i>that face.</i>

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:04.610
<i>The sound of my
heartbeat is so noisy...</i>

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:17.870
<i>...that I can't hear the fireworks.</i>

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.500
<i>The first day of the new school term.</i>

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:28.510
<i>Everyone has come back
to their ordinary lives</i>

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:33.310
<i>with melancholy and hope in their hearts
after a long, uneventful summer.</i>

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:38.020
KAGUYA DOESN'T WANT
TO AVOID HIM

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:38.020
<i>One man looks back upon...</i>

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:40.230
TRACING SHIROGANE'S EFFORTS
SAVING A SPOT SIX HOURS
BEFORE THE DISPLAY

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:40.810
GETS THE NEWS THAT SHINOMIYA
CAN'T GO, CALCULATES
HOW SHE REALLY FEELS FROM HER TWEET

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:41.400
RIDES LIKE THE WIND
TO SHINOMIYA'S FAMILY'S HOUSE

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:42.060
USING BINOCULARS OUTSIDE THE HOUSE,
REALIZES SHINOMIYA IS USING
A "BODY DOUBLE" (HAYASAKA),
GOES BACK THE WAY HE CAME AT MACH SPEED

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:42.570
MAKES CALCULATIONS IN HIS HEAD,
FIGURES OUT THE ROUTE SHINOMIYA TOOK,
DETERMINES HER LOCATION

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:42.570
USES THE EVENT INFO
HE HAD INPUT EARLIER,
RIDES LIKE THE WIND
IN A TAXI TO KISARAZU

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:45.030
PAYS THE CAB FARE TO THE TUNE
OF 17,320 YEN (TAKEN FROM
THE POTENTIAL "SHINOMIYA
SUMMER VACATION BUDGET")

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:44.400
USES THE EVENT INFO
HE HAD INPUT EARLIER,
RIDES LIKE THE WIND
IN A TAXI TO KISARAZU

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:45.530
<i>...a memory he made at the end.</i>

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:49.280
<i>Then, I'll show them to you.</i>

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:52.620
Nooo!

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.780
<i>And he regrets so much
that he wishes he could die!</i>

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:59.750
<i>You mean the "Guess Shinomiya's Thoughts
and Search for Her" game?</i>

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:02.500
Ow! It hurts!

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:03.960
It hurts so bad!

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:09.630
<i>A dark past!</i>

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:11.840
<i>Summer vacation was all but over,</i>

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:14.640
<i>and Shirogane hadn't seen
Shinomiya even once.</i>

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:16.390
<i>By the day of the fireworks,</i>

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:21.020
<i>Shirogane was so tense
that he couldn't hold it back!</i>

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.900
<i>There she is!</i>

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:26.940
<i>That bursting tension caused him
to blurt out a series of cringeworthy lines!</i>

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:24.270
<i>Then, I'll show them to you.</i>

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:28.280
<i>You mean the "Guess Shinomiya's Thoughts
and Search for Her" game?</i>

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:31.530
<i>Compared to the usual,
it was 100 times easier.</i>

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:32.780
<i>I don't know!</i>

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:35.030
<i>But it's worth the challenge.</i>

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:40.920
<i>It's a dark past</i>

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:44.790
<i>that will make him writhe in pain
when he recalls it for the next ten-odd years!</i>

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:48.800
<i>If I saw Shinomiya now...</i>

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:52.640
<i>I don't know what to say,</i>

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:55.640
<i>but the words you said that night...
How can I put it?</i>

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:58.770
<i>I guess you were like on an ego trip.</i>

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:00.810
<i>President...</i>

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:03.600
<i>it was painful.</i>

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:06.900
<i>Somebody, kill me!</i>

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:09.360
Let's have fun this semester, too!

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:11.450
O-Oh, Fujiwara!

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:13.320
Shinomiya, too.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:15.320
STUDENT COUNCIL ROOM

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:26.340
Hmph.

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:29.590
<i>She won't even look at me!</i>

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:33.590
<i>She views me as someone
who's too pathetic to look at directly!</i>

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:37.010
- Shinomiya, about the other night—
- Hmph.

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:47.360
<i>It's worse than I thought!</i>

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:48.610
Look at all this dust!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:51.110
<i>She thinks of me as someone
who's too pathetic to even be around!</i>

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:55.110
<i>Wrong! Certainly,
Kaguya is avoiding Shirogane.</i>

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:57.990
<i>But it's definitely not out of any ill will.</i>

00:16:57.990 --> 00:16:59.620
<i>In fact, it's just the opposite.</i>

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:03.710
<i>These actions are induced
by bashfulness and nervousness.</i>

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:07.880
<i>Perhaps it might be called
"like-avoidance."</i>

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:11.630
<i>Wh-Why am I avoiding him?</i>

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:18.640
<i>I-It's like I'm self-conscious
around him or something!</i>

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:18.640
HRRRMMM

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:20.310
<i>Talk to him.</i>

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:22.140
<i>Just like you did
before summer vacation.</i>

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:24.890
<i>I have to win Shinomiya's trust back!</i>

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:28.900
<i>Naturally, cheerfully...</i>

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:32.900
<i>I-I'll greet her naturally first!</i>

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:41.410
<i>A straight line linked them
as they moved from opposite directions.</i>

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:44.410
<i>A development that would certainly
make them talk to each other.</i>

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:47.420
<i>However...</i>

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:04.310
Miss Fujiwara,
we need to clean the floor first.

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:06.230
Oh, that's right!

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:09.690
Dusty.

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:13.650
<i>It's hard to strike up a conversation!</i>

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:14.860
I'll clean over here.

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:18.660
<i>They were both back in the saddle,
ready to give it another go!</i>

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:21.830
<i>And yet the result was the same.</i>

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:26.460
<i>No good! The closer I get to the president,
the harder it is to look at him directly!</i>

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:29.460
<i>What kind of expression should I have
when I say something to Shinomiya?</i>

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:32.630
<i>They continued to pass each other by,</i>

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:34.380
<i>just barely missing,</i>

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:36.630
<i>like two aircraft in a dogfight!</i>

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.510
<i>But walking by each other twice
is unnatural.</i>

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:42.890
<i>Was it a coincidence?</i>

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:48.270
<i>I see. The president is being shy.</i>

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:52.270
<i>In that case, there's no need
for me to be bashful.</i>

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:54.690
<i>I'm totally calm.</i>

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:55.900
<i>I can do this!</i>

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:58.530
<i>This time, I can go over to him.</i>

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:00.610
<i>I can go over to her!</i>

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.250
An asterisk!

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:19.590
Miss Fujiwara,
are you making fun of me?

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:22.390
Keep your mind on the cleaning!

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:25.310
What are the rules of this game?

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:28.180
<i>I have to talk to her
and clear up this misunderstanding!</i>

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:29.440
<i>This time, for sure!</i>

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:32.060
<i>I see! It's not an asterisk!</i>

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:33.770
Hey, what's up?

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:38.280
<i>But it's a triangle!</i>

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.700
Now what?

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:45.490
You're mocking me, too, aren't you?

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.830
Did I do something?

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:51.330
Jeez, you don't get it at all,
do you, Ishigami?

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:53.540
Why are you suddenly
looking down on me?

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:56.460
Ishigami, am I really
that amusing to you?

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:57.670
You, too, President?

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:02.050
I'm sorry.

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:04.680
This is over my head,
so I'm going home.

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:06.180
<i>Ishigami was shot down.</i>

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:09.350
Poor Ishigami. But four's a crowd.

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:11.190
Three's a crowd, Miss Fujiwara.

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:17.400
Why?

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:19.530
<i>Fujiwara was shot down.</i>

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:23.820
<i>What the hell is going on here?</i>

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:26.280
<i>I know I've been avoiding her,</i>

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:29.410
<i>but Shinomiya has been doing
the same thing, too, repeatedly.</i>

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:32.210
<i>Maybe...</i>

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:35.710
<i>she feels self-conscious!</i>

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.710
<i>Calm down, Kaguya!</i>

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:39.710
<i>Close your eyes! It'll be okay!</i>

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:44.680
<i>Maybe she didn't think
I was pathetic but actually cool!</i>

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:46.970
<i>Shirogane was back on his feet!</i>

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:48.970
<i>This time for sure!</i>

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:50.560
<i>This time...</i>

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:07.660
There's something
I really wanted to tell you, President.

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:11.540
President, on the night of the fireworks...

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:14.210
<i>I have to tell him.</i>

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:17.670
<i>I have to say "Thank you"!</i>

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:22.380
Um,

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:25.050
that was painful, huh?

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:28.680
<i>President, on the night of the fireworks...</i>

00:21:29.310 --> 00:21:34.060
<i>Painful, painful, painful, painful,
painful, painful, painful, painful...</i>

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:36.100
<i>That was painful, huh?</i>

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:41.530
I-I know, right?

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:43.650
<i>Shirogane was shot down.</i>

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:46.780
President!
There's something I want to tell you!

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:50.330
I-I get it already!

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:52.450
Please wait up, President!

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:59.040
RESULTS OF TODAY'S MATCH:

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:59.040
FLYING ACE SHINOMIYA'S
VICTORY

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:56.210
<i>And so, they were back to normal.</i>

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.630
<i>The second semester had begun.</i>

00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:35.060
<i>A romantic battle of the brains.</i>

00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:38.640
<i>A battle of the sexes in which
neither side can afford to be honest.</i>

00:23:38.930 --> 00:23:40.690
<i>With unspoken feelings
hidden in their hearts,</i>

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:43.400
<i>they continue making their wish</i>

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:45.900
<i>for the other person to confess their love.</i>

00:23:46.440 --> 00:23:49.070
I swear I'll make you say it.

00:23:49.070 --> 00:23:57.040
KAGUYA-SAMA: LOVE IS WAR

00:23:50.820 --> 00:23:52.280
You'll say "I love you."
